  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The VRChat Wiki is responding incorrectly to `favicon.ico` requests during maintenance. A HTTP error code response (typically 503 Service Unavailable) is expected for the page itself, but not for the `favicon.ico` resource. This means without browser caching, the expected VRChat Wiki favicon won't be displayed in a browser during maintenance.\n\nAffected URL: https://wiki.vrchat.com/favicon.ico\n\nExpected result: HTTP 200 OK (for the `favicon.ico` resource only)\n\nActual result: HTTP 403 Forbidden for `favicon.ico` during maintenance.\n\nRelated: https://status.vrchat.com/incidents/xg3n4y6875w6",
